      <dl class="wquick__spec">
        <div><dt>Fabric &amp; Fit</dt><dd>European cut, sits closer than standard American suiting</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Lead Time</dt><dd>4&#8211;6 business days, made to order</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Sizing Note</dt><dd>If your usual size is 42+, size up one</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Trouser</dt><dd>Drop 6 &#8212; waist runs 6&#8221; under the jacket size</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div>
        <p class="wquick__sizelabel">Jacket Size <span class="wquick__sizelabel-note">US &#8212; EU runs US&#8202;+&#8202;10</span></p>
